# 统一换行符：源码用 LF，Windows 批处理用 CRLF，二进制不做转换
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 图片 / 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary

# Git 语言统计时把生成资源排除掉，免得语言构成被图片淹没
web/assets/** linguist-generated=true
docs/** linguist-documentation=true
